    "basis": "Named station POI establishes approximate identity/center. Main layer1 roof1560 andtilecopy2648 plus internal closed passenger components856/857/942/1284/1285/1334 andtilecopy2538 are preliminary physical matches,not exact Wikidata-tagged building matches. The main roof has a hole/opening that must remain represented. Preserve separate Waverley Market1566 (layer-1,mall), Balmoral/nearby hotel parts including1576 andother native buildings. Preserve Waverley Bridge andNorth Bridge roads/rails;the model should not absorb these independent bridges. Ground masks belong only to actual closed occupied floors,never the full layer1 platform-roof exterior. Also replace alternate outer-roof803 andits tilecopy2229 (same layer1 field,without the relation hole). These are duplicate roof representations,not independent neighbors. Source retains the real central booking-hall opening andrefines the modern entrance/stair cutouts fromthe ordinary picture."
